  "title": "Methanex Corporation - Notice of Cash Dividend - Methanex",
  "summary": "VANCOUVER, British Columbia, July 15, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) — Methanex Corporation (the “Company” or “Methanex”) (TSX: MX) (Nasdaq: MEOH) announced today that its Board of Directors has declared a quarterly dividend of US$0.185 per share. The dividend will be payable on September 30, 2026, to holders of common shares of record on September 16, 2026. […]",
